Dear Sage,

I am messaging in order to inform that you are officially my assigned
supervisor for personal project, alongside would like to share some of the
general foundational pillars.

Learning Goal:
To learn how small language models can be made reliable and persistent
within a phone=E2=80=99s limited resources by investigating how model selec=
tion,
quantization, context management, and prompt design affect memory
retention, factual grounding, and response performance on a real device.

Product Goal:
To create a minimal Android notes app that uses small language models
running on-device to organize notes, answer questions grounded in stored
information, and use that information proactively when relevant.

The scope of the project is on the response quality and functionality of
the harness, not the application's visual completeness. Therefore, the
majority of the time will be spent on learning the underlying concepts and
benchmarking different models and configurations

Last but not least, I=E2=80=99d also appreciate a short meeting next week t=
o
